Patent Capital OS is an open-source skill and workflow toolkit for
local patent intake, evidence-bound draft generation, AI legal/compliance
gating, application-material preparation, quality review, and read-only
pre-submission handoff.

This project does not provide legal advice and does not perform real
official patent filing by default.
